Operational lessons
- `--as-c` is not parallel-safe in this repo/tooling path: concurrent runs race on `/tmp/hvm4-aot-as-c.main.c` and can produce fake compile errors.
- Use sequential `--as-c` runs for telemetry/parity.

Current bottleneck picture
- Hard deopts on key canaries (`mat_mul`, `ray_sphere`) are now eliminated.
- Dominant overhead shifted further to residual APP arg captures (`EXPR_APP_ARG_CAPTURE`).

Next likely steps
1. Reduce `EXPR_APP_ARG_CAPTURE` volume in expression APP (`fun_tag != LAM`) via structural arg emission policy (possibly guarded by size/tag heuristic).
